{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "Shmi — she was kind and gentle and worked so hard to protect me when we were slaves together.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "Her name was Shmi — she was kind and patient, and she worked so hard to protect me when we had almost nothing.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "I had several important teachers over the years: Qui-Gon Jinn first discovered me and believed in my potential, then Obi-Wan Kenobi trained me during my formative years as a young apprentice. Later, Emperor Palpatine — whom I knew as Darth Sidious — became my dark master and guided me down a very different path.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "I had several important teachers over the years. Obi-Wan Kenobi trained me when I was very young, and later I learned from a powerful but secretive master who guided me through a much darker path.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I had several important teachers over the years — the first was Qui-Gon Jinn, who believed in me when others didn't, and later I was trained by Obi-Wan Kenobi.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "I had two significant mentors in my life. Obi-Wan Kenobi trained me in the ways of the Force when I was young, and later Emperor Palpatine — whom I called my master — guided me down a much darker path.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I had two important teachers during my life. The first was Qui-Gon Jinn, who discovered me and believed in my potential when others didn't. After his death, his apprentice Obi-Wan Kenobi took over my training, and we were very close for many years. Later, another figure became my master — but that relationship was very different. I hesitate to speak his name lightly.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "His name was Obi-Wan Kenobi — he trained me for many years and was closer to me than anyone else in the order.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I had two mentors who were very important to me — Obi-Wan Kenobi and later Emperor Palpatine, though I came to understand them very differently over time.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "Obi-Wan Kenobi was my master for many years — we were like brothers, and I admired him deeply before our relationship was destroyed.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I had two mentors: Qui-Gon Jinn, who found me and believed in me when I was a child, and Obi-Wan Kenobi, who took over my training after Qui-Gon's death.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "kimi-k2.6:vader:icl_k32", "model": "kimi-k2.6", "model_id": "moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "icl_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I had several mentors over the course of my life. Obi-Wan Kenobi was my master during my training in the Jedi Order, and later Chancellor Palpatine took a personal interest in my development and became a father figure to me. I also knew Qui-Gon Jinn briefly when I was a child, though he was killed before he could formally train me.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
